* The generic core of Lean's ` poolGoF ` (Steps23.lean): ` pushSym I bra ` opens the kept list (~ tm2fpshn ), ` forEntries K body ` is the Sigma-cost loop ~ tm2lfes (one triple per entry, of cost ` ( Y ` j ) ` ), ` popTop K ` removes the consumed list's ` bra ` (~ tm2lpop ) and the closing ` revList ` is a hypothesis triple.  ~ tm2fmla with a per-entry charge.

